  "note": "Every task this round was built out of a round-12 TIE — a same-generation tie is where the defects BOTH builds share are visible, and round 12 tied fourteen of eighteen. Arm A swept 18/18 on the first pass; arm B needed two re-runs (VC3, then FR3), both CDP timeouts in the driver rather than app failures.",
